      "mergeID": "5e63181ad785c763f3f8236d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When you go into a world with others in it or follow someone to a world, sometimes their avatar will be at spawn or another place, I'm not sure if its random or not, move like they're running when on their screen they are running around and will talk like they're stood there but when i ask my friends where they are, they might say the opposite side of the world on their screen. Some times, they'll just float there doing nothing and cant hear you speak until you get near their avatar but they're actually behind you and were wondering why you were ignoring them but their avatars aren't where they are for them on your screen. The screenshot with this post is of my friend who said they're actually behind me and were walking around the whole time with me and I was ignoring them but I could only hear them once i got to their bugged avatar. I've had this bug quite a few times on many worlds with various friends and what usually fixes it is leaving the world to another then coming back to the world but even then sometimes they'll still be bugged and you have to try again.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "People's avatars staying at spawn for some people but they are actually moving.",
      "parentID": null,
